@startuml
[*] --> Start
Start : Begin Triage Process

Start --> LifeThreatening
LifeThreatening : Assess if life-threatening condition

LifeThreatening --> {yes} Immediate
Immediate : Immediate treatment required
Immediate --> End
LifeThreatening --> {no} Urgency

Urgency : Determine urgency level
Urgency --> Critical
Critical : Is the condition critical?

Critical --> {yes} VeryUrgent
VeryUrgent : High priority treatment
VeryUrgent --> End
Critical --> {no} Moderate

Moderate : Is the condition moderate?
Moderate --> {yes} Urgent
Urgent : Urgent but not life-threatening
Urgent --> End
Moderate --> {no} Evaluate

Evaluate : Evaluate remaining factors
Evaluate --> LowPriority
LowPriority : Non-urgent, routine care
LowPriority --> End

End : Assign clinical priority and direct care
@enduml